0..38 Comment "// This source shows inert operations."
39..41 Comment "//"
42..116 Comment "// An inert operation identifies a package. It does not define the package"
117..191 Comment "// content. So an edit to an inert operation moves the content of no other"
192..207 Comment "// declaration."
208..210 Comment "//"
211..286 Comment "// The checker allows a manifest step and another inert declaration to read"
287..366 Comment "// it. A top-level definition marked inert is such a declaration. The component"
367..444 Comment "// of a model for an inert operation is inert. An `include` carries the mark."
445..447 Comment "//"
448..463 Comment "// - see: #3029"
464..519 Comment "// - see: #6141 — a top-level definition marked inert"
520..568 Comment "// - see: pathological/modules/inert-field.gandr"
